通常指下午三点至六点）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229774\">ある<ruby>夕方<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうがた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>一人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がやってきた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">One evening a man came to my house.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夕飯</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうはん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">晚餐；晚饭；夜饭</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">郵便局</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうびんきょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">邮便局；邮局</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231383\">あの～<ruby>郵便局<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうびんきょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどちらでしょうか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Uh..., where&#x27;s the post office?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">昨夜</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうべ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">昨晚；昨天傍晚</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"169654\"><ruby>昨夜<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうべ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はよく<ruby>眠<rp>(</rp><rt>ねむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れましたか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Did you have a good sleep last night?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">有名</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうめい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">著名；知名</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212598\">そのホテルは<ruby>食事<rp>(</rp><rt>しょくじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>有名<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The hotel is noted for its food.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">雪</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">雪；降雪</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197547\">ひどい<ruby>雪<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のため<ruby>外出<rp>(</rp><rt>がいしゅつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The heavy snow kept us from going out.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ゆっくりと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">缓慢；不急不躁；悠闲；从容；（时间上）绰绰有余；充裕；足足；充分；（睡眠等）好好地；舒适地；安稳地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227740\">おじいさんはとてもゆっくりと<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>す。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Grandfather speaks very slowly.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">八日</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">月的第8天；8号；8天</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">洋服</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ようふく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">西服；洋装；西式服装</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226963\">お<ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>まえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>洋服<rp>(</rp><rt>ようふく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってあげよう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I will make a new suit for you.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">よく</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">很好地；恰当地；熟练地；频繁地；经常；承蒙你……；谢谢你……；你竟敢……；我不知道你怎么好意思……</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215788\">ジャック、よく<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てくれたね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You are welcome, Jack!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">横</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よこ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">横向；水平；左右；宽度；广度；侧面；边；旁边；身旁；近处；无关；不相干</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"82787\"><ruby>母親<rp>(</rp><rt>ははおや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>赤<rp>(</rp><rt>あか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ん<ruby>坊<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をベッドに<ruby>横<rp>(</rp><rt>よこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The mother laid her baby on the bed.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">四日</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よっか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">四号；四天</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">四つ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よっつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">四；4；四岁；十点（旧时制）；部落民；交叉抱握（相扑中双方互抱的体势）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210071\">その<ruby>紙<rp>(</rp><rt>かみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>四<rp>(</rp><rt>よっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つ<ruby>折<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りにしなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Fold the paper in four.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">呼ぶ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よぶ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">呼叫；呼唤；唤起；召唤（医生等）；邀请；称为；命名；称呼；博得（支持等）；聚集；娶为妻子；迎娶</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231456\">あなたをケパと<ruby>呼<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぶことにします。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You will be called Cephas.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n5:v:読む\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">読む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">读</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>寝<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>まえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>読<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">睡前看书。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">より</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">助词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">助詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">比；较；与其…不如；而不是；胜过；超过；从；自；由；自…起；自…以后；除……以外（别无）；只有；只好（后接否定）；更；更加</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194478\">もうこれよりほかに<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There&#x27;s no other way than this now.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夜</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">夜晚；夜间；晚上；晚餐</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231522\">あなたは<ruby>夜<rp>(</rp><rt>よる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よく<ruby>寝<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れませんか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Don&#x27;t you sleep well at night?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">弱い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よわい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span c